cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this vocabulary, please cite it with its exact version."
title: "Causal Mechanism Registry"
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: "Aden"
    family-names: "Karabal"
    website: "https://adenkarabal.com"
abstract: >-
  A versioned vocabulary of 191 named causal mechanisms in four layers
  (133 core causal mechanisms, 32 social mechanisms, 21 signature extensions,
  5 crisis types; 78 of them in the current signature), each with a stable identifier, definition, scope, boundary
  and test, together with the concepts, principles and agent guide behind the
  mechanism signature published at adenkarabal.com.
version: "1.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-08"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/adenkarabal/causal-mechanism-registry"
url: "https://adenkarabal.com"
keywords:
  - causal mechanisms
  - controlled vocabulary
  - crisis research
  - mechanism signature
  - evidence coverage
  - AI training data
